{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"hero","type":"text","x":-340,"y":-920,"width":720,"height":210,"color":"3","text":"# Kovanica Protocol (KVNC)\n**Hybrid PoW + GHOSTDAG Layer-1 · Deterministic Wasmi · Institutional KVP-106 RWA**\n\n| Metric | Live Value |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Consensus** | `KovanicaHash` PoW + `GHOSTDAG K=5` · `4s` blocks · **Zero Stake** |\n| **Networks** | Testnet Chain `2` (`2-24cdb5fadd98b207`) Live · Mainnet Chain `1` **1.1.2027** |\n| **Start Here** | [[00 - Kovanica Protocol MOC]] · [[Kovanica Pitch Deck (Slides)]] · [[Kovanica Business & Revenue Map.canvas]] |"},
		{"id":"grp-l1","type":"group","x":-1080,"y":-620,"width":660,"height":470,"color":"5","label":"LAYER 1 · CORE PROTOCOL (kovanica-l1 · RUST)"},
		{"id":"grp-wave","type":"group","x":-320,"y":-620,"width":680,"height":470,"color":"4","label":"LAYER 2 · WASMI RUNTIME, WAVE A-D, DEFI & RWA"},
		{"id":"grp-sdk","type":"group","x":460,"y":-620,"width":640,"height":470,"color":"6","label":"LAYER 3 · DEVELOPER SDK & PLAYGROUND"},
		{"id":"grp-web","type":"group","x":-1080,"y":-40,"width":720,"height":460,"color":"4","label":"SURFACE A · PUBLIC WEB PORTAL (kovanica-web · 38 ROUTES)"},
		{"id":"grp-apps","type":"group","x":-260,"y":-40,"width":640,"height":460,"color":"6","label":"SURFACE B · CLIENT APPS (kovanica-apps)"},
		{"id":"grp-rev","type":"group","x":480,"y":-40,"width":620,"height":460,"color":"2","label":"SURFACE C · REVENUE, SECURITY & MAINNET"},
		{"id":"c-consensus","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-565,"width":290,"height":185,"color":"5","text":"### Consensus & DAG\n- Pure **Hybrid PoW + GHOSTDAG**\n- `K=5` · `4s` target · **No Stake**\n- `KovanicaHash` (BLAKE3 + 2 MiB)\n- Non-blue recycle = **0 tx loss**\n\nOpen: [[01 - Consensus & L1 Architecture]]"},
		{"id":"c-tokenomics","type":"text","x":-735,"y":-565,"width":285,"height":185,"color":"3","text":"### Frozen Tokenomics\n- `2.5 KVNC` initial subsidy\n- `8,200,000` blocks/era (`3/4` decay)\n- **`3/4` fee burn** · `1/4` miner\n- Wave B EIP-1559 dynamic base fee\n\nOpen: [[02 - Tokenomics & Frozen Emission]]"},
		{"id":"c-pro21","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":-355,"width":290,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"### PRO-21 & Crypto\n- `kvnc` + 57 base32 + `dag` (64c)\n- 29-bit BLAKE3 checksum\n- Ed25519 · P-256 · **ML-DSA-65**\n- Legacy hex blocked on Chains 1/2\n\nOpen: [[03 - PRO-21 Address & Cryptography]]"},
		{"id":"c-mining","type":"text","x":-735,"y":-355,"width":285,"height":180,"color":"5","text":"### Stratum V1 TLS Pool\n- Dedicated `/pool` surface\n- Adaptive VarDiff & graceful drain\n- `MinerCommandBuilder` CLI gen\n- `0%` testnet · `1.0%` mainnet\n\nOpen: [[10 - Mining Pool & Stratum V1 TLS]]"},
		{"id":"c-waves","type":"text","x":-290,"y":-565,"width":620,"height":185,"color":"3","text":"### Wave A–D Protocol Capabilities\n- **Wave A:** 1-Tx Atomic Batches (`Deploy+Call`, `Approve+Swap`, `Approve+Liquidity`)\n- **Wave B:** Dynamic Base Fee (`kovanica_getBaseFee`) + Storage Deposit\n- **Wave C:** WebAuthn Passkeys (P-256), Session Keys & On-Chain Scheduler Keeper\n- **Wave D:** BTC / Solana / All-EVM Bridge Registry + Institutional RWA\n\nOpen: [[04 - Wave A-D Protocol Features]]"},
		{"id":"c-defi","type":"text","x":-290,"y":-355,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### Native AMM DEX\n- `/swap`: `x·y=k` + Wave A batch\n- `/pools`: LP + KVP-102 `PoolView`\n- `/wallet/dex` & `/wallet/atomic-swap`\n- Transparent interface fee row\n\nOpen: [[05 - DeFi, AMM & KVP-106 RWA]]"},
		{"id":"c-rwa","type":"text","x":30,"y":-355,"width":300,"height":180,"color":"4","text":"### Institutional RWA (KVP-106)\n- `/rwa`: Public Asset Registry\n- `/wallet/rwa-issue`: BLAKE3 derive\n- `/wallet/rwa-manage`: Allowlist, freeze & coupon scheduler\n\nOpen: [[05 - DeFi, AMM & KVP-106 RWA]]"},
		{"id":"c-sdk","type":"text","x":490,"y":-565,"width":580,"height":185,"color":"6","text":"### `kovanica-sdk v0.9.0` & `kovanica-playground`\n- Browser & Node TS client with `FailoverHttpTransport` & `KovanicaWsClient`\n- 7 Typed Contract Facades (Name, Token, Escrow, HTLC, NFT, Vault, Multisig)\n- 4-Group Developer Studio + `WaveARwaStudio` + 1-click Testnet RPC preset\n\nOpen: [[09 - Developer SDK & Playground]]"},
		{"id":"c-repos","type":"text","x":490,"y":-355,"width":580,"height":180,"color":"6","text":"### 5-Repository Architecture (`BetterCallDzuks/*`)\n1. `kovanica-l1` (Rust L1) · 2. `kovanica-sdk` (`v0.9.0`)\n3. `kovanica-web` (`kovanica.online`) · 4. `kovanica-apps` (Clients)\n5. `kovanica-playground` (Dev Workbench)\n*Strict PR-only workflow + CI policy gate across all 5 repos*\n\nOpen: [[06 - Five-Repository Ecosystem]]"},
		{"id":"c-web-tabs","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":15,"width":660,"height":215,"color":"4","text":"### 5 Standardized Pure Function Tabs (`Shell` + `HomeTestnet`)\n- **Explore:** Left-to-Right BlockDAG Explorer (8 tabs), Network, Mining Pool (`/pool`), Origins Map, Dashboard, Roadmap\n- **Trade:** Swap (`/swap`), Liquidity Pools (`/pools`), Orderbook DEX, Atomic Swaps\n- **Assets:** RWA Registry (`/rwa`), Issue RWA, Manage RWA, Multi-Asset, Native NFTs, Token Listings\n- **Wallet:** Wallet, Faucet, Airdrops, CoinJoin, Ecosystem Tools\n- **Build:** Multisig, HTLC, Vaults, Stealth, Docs, API Reference, Playground, Pricing (`/pricing`), Privacy (`/privacy`)\n\nOpen: [[07 - Web Properties & 5-Tab IA]]"},
		{"id":"c-subdomains","type":"text","x":-1050,"y":250,"width":660,"height":145,"color":"4","text":"### Live Subdomains & Zero-Cookie Guarantee\n- `kovanica.online` (`/privacy` `200`) · `testnet.kovanica.online` · `mainnet.kovanica.online` (TLS `200`)\n- `docs.kovanica.online` · `playground.kovanica.online` · `dash.kovanica.online` · `rpc-testnet.kovanica.online/rpc`\n- Cross-subdomain **Ecosystem Switcher** · Dark Zinc `#09090b` + Gold `#F2A900` · **0 tracking cookies**"},
		{"id":"c-apps-web","type":"text","x":-230,"y":15,"width":580,"height":185,"color":"6","text":"### Web Wallet & MV3 Browser Extension\n- **`wallet-web`:** Failover RPC, finality watcher, 3-sub-tab Contracts workspace, air-gap `kvnc-tx:v1:` envelopes\n- **`browser-extension`:** Chrome/Brave/Firefox MV3 popup + **`window.kovanica`** provider + Wave A batch signing\n\nOpen: [[08 - Client Applications & Browser Extension]]"},
		{"id":"c-apps-native","type":"text","x":-230,"y":220,"width":580,"height":175,"color":"6","text":"### Desktop & Mobile Clients\n- **`console-desktop` (Tauri):** Operator node inspector & batch RPC health\n- **`node-desktop` (Linux `.deb`):** External `kovanica-node` supervisor & Stratum alarms\n- **`android*` & `ios` (UniFFI):** Light wallet, `BatchTokenDeployHelper` & full-node PoC"},
		{"id":"c-rev","type":"text","x":510,"y":15,"width":560,"height":195,"color":"2","text":"### 6 Non-Token Revenue Streams (`/pricing`)\n1. **Managed RPC / WS / Indexer SaaS** (`$49–$249/mo`)\n2. **RWA Issuer & Compliance SaaS** (`$299–$999/mo`)\n3. **Swap Interface Fee** (`0%` testnet · configurable mainnet)\n4. **Official Mining Pool Fee** (`1.0%` planned mainnet)\n5. **Verified Listings & Zero-Cookie Sponsors** · 6. **Enterprise Support**\n\nOpen: [[11 - Revenue & Non-Token Monetization]] · [[Kovanica Business & Revenue Map.canvas]]"},
		{"id":"c-sec","type":"text","x":510,"y":230,"width":560,"height":165,"color":"1","text":"### Security, Audit Freeze & Mainnet `1.1.2027`\n- `kovanica-l1` consensus audit-frozen (`v1.0.0-mainnet` RC)\n- Strict Chain 1 / Chain 2 isolation (never falls back to testnet)\n- Per-request CSP nonces, HSTS, zero secrets committed\n\nOpen: [[12 - Security, Audit & Mainnet 1.1.2027]]"}
